  ('b842b753-cf3b-446d-938a-ec42e6776f9d', '627739e7-79a9-43a8-b2b8-99e5ef8f89ac', 'b4a08ac4-c145-47f8-b115-7352170ac23d', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Mohr’s circle', 'Mohr’s circle identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within stress transformation. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. After principal stress, mohr’s circle supplies what is needed to address strain rosettes.', 2),
